{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "saina-chit-backend-v1",
    "name": "Saina Chit Backend API",
    "description": "Postman collection for Saina Chit Funds backend (`chit-backend`).\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection and `Saina-Chit-Backend.local.postman_environment.json`\n2. Select the **Saina Local** environment\n3. Run `npm run seed` on the backend, then start the server (`npm run dev`)\n4. Use **Auth → Login flows** to request OTP and verify — the access token is saved automatically\n\n## Demo credentials (after seed)\n| Role | Auth slug | Phone | Aadhaar | OTP |\n|------|-----------|-------|---------|-----|\n| Super Admin | super-admin | 9999999999 | 123456789012 | 123456 |\n| Branch Store | admin or branch-store | 9888888881 | 111111111111 | 123456 |\n| Agent | agent | 9888888882 | 222222222222 | 123456 |\n| Bidder | bidder | 9888888883 | 333333333333 | 123456 |\n\n## Auth\nProtected routes use `Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{accessToken}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:4000" },
    { "key": "apiVersion", "value": "v1" },
    { "key": "apiBase", "value": "{{baseUrl}}/api/{{apiVersion}}" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "countryCode", "value": "+91" },
    { "key": "mockOtp", "value": "123456" },
    { "key": "superAdminPhone", "value": "9999999999" },
    { "key": "superAdminAadhaar", "value": "123456789012" },
    { "key": "branchStorePhone", "value": "9888888881" },
    { "key": "branchStoreAadhaar", "value": "111111111111" },
    { "key": "agentPhone", "value": "9888888882" },
    { "key": "agentAadhaar", "value": "222222222222" },
    { "key": "bidderPhone", "value": "9888888883" },
    { "key": "bidderAadhaar", "value": "333333333333" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["health"]
            },
            "description": "Server liveness check. No authentication required."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Phone + Aadhaar OTP login per role. After **Verify OTP**, the access token is saved to `accessToken`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Super Admin",
          "item": [
            {
              "name": "Request OTP",
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"{{countryCode}}\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{superAdminPhone}}\",\n  \"aadhaarNumber\": \"{{superAdminAadhaar}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{apiBase}}/auth/super-admin/request-otp",
                  "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
                  "path": ["auth", "super-admin", "request-otp"]
                }
              },
              "response": []
            },
            {
              "name": "Verify OTP (saves token)",
              "event": [
                {
                  "listen": "test",
                  "script": {
                    "exec": [
                      "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                      "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                      "    if (json.data && json.data.accessToken) {",
                      "        pm.environment.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                      "        pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', json.data.accessToken);",
                      "        console.log('accessToken saved');",
                      "    }",
                      "}"
                    ],
                    "type": "text/javascript"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "request": {
                "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"countryCode\": \"{{countryCode}}\",\n  \"phone\": \"{{superAdminPhone}}\",\n  \"aadhaarNumber\": \"{{superAdminAadhaar}}\",\n  \"otp\": \"{{mockOtp}}\"\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{apiBase}}/auth/super-admin/verify-otp",
                  "host": ["{{apiBase}}"],
                  "path": ["auth", "super-admin", "verify-otp"]
                }
              },
              "response": []
            }
          ]
        },
